{"id":"torrey:houses","source":"torrey","name":"Houses","slug":"houses","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Antiquity of — Ge 12:1; 19:3.","refs":[["Gen",12,1,12,1],["Gen",19,3,19,3]]},{"text":"Deep and solid foundations required for — Mt 7:24; Lu 6:48.","refs":[["Matt",7,24,7,24],["Luke",6,48,6,48]]},{"text":"Sometimes built without foundation — Mt 7:26; Lu 6:49.","refs":[["Matt",7,26,7,26],["Luke",6,49,6,49]]},{"text":"Clay. — Job 4:19.","refs":[["Job",4,19,4,19]]},{"text":"Bricks. — Ex 1:11-14; Isa 9:10.","refs":[["Exod",1,11,1,14],["Isa",9,10,9,10]]},{"text":"Stone and wood. — Le 14:40,42; Hab 2:11.","refs":[["Lev",14,40,14,40],["Lev",14,42,14,42],["Hab",2,11,2,11]]},{"text":"Hewn or cut stone. — Isa 3:10; Am 5:11.","refs":[["Isa",3,10,3,10],["Amos",5,11,5,11]]},{"text":"In cities, built in streets — Ge 19:2; Jos 2:19.","refs":[["Gen",19,2,19,2],["Josh",2,19,2,19]]},{"text":"Often built on city walls — Jos 2:15; 2Co 11:33.","refs":[["Josh",2,15,2,15],["2Cor",11,33,11,33]]},{"text":"Surrounded with battlements. — De 22:8.","refs":[["Deut",22,8,22,8]]},{"text":"Had often booths on them. — 2Sa 16:22; Ne 8:16; Pr 2:19.","refs":[["2Sam",16,22,16,22],["Neh",8,16,8,16],["Prov",2,19,2,19]]},{"text":"Had often idolatrous altars on them. — 2Ki 23:12; Jer 19:13; Zep 1:5.","refs":[["2Kgs",23,12,23,12],["Jer",19,13,19,13],["Zeph",1,5,1,5]]},{"text":"Used for drying flax. — Jos 2:6.","refs":[["Josh",2,6,2,6]]},{"text":"Used for exercise. — 2Sa 11:2; Da 4:29.","refs":[["2Sam",11,2,11,2],["Dan",4,29,4,29]]},{"text":"Used for devotion. — Ac 10:9.","refs":[["Acts",10,9,10,9]]},{"text":"Used for making proclamations. — Lu 12:3.","refs":[["Luke",12,3,12,3]]},{"text":"Used for secret conference. — 1Sa 9:25,26.","refs":[["1Sam",9,25,9,25],["1Sam",9,26,9,26]]},{"text":"Resorted to in grief. — Isa 15:3; Jer 48:38.","refs":[["Isa",15,3,15,3],["Jer",48,38,48,38]]},{"text":"Often covered with week grass. — Ps 129:6,7.","refs":[["Ps",129,6,129,6],["Ps",129,7,129,7]]},{"text":"Accessible from the outside — Mt 24:17.","refs":[["Matt",24,17,24,17]]},{"text":"The courts of, large and used as apartments — Es 1:5; Lu 5:19.","refs":[["Esth",1,5,1,5],["Luke",5,19,5,19]]},{"text":"Entered by a gate or door — Ge 43:19; Ex 12:22; Lu 16:20; Ac 10:17.","refs":[["Gen",43,19,43,19],["Exod",12,22,12,22],["Luke",16,20,16,20],["Acts",10,17,10,17]]},{"text":"Doors of, low and small for safety — Pr 17:19.","refs":[["Prov",17,19,17,19]]},{"text":"Doors of, how fastened — 2Sa 13:18; Song 5:5; Lu 11:7.","refs":[["2Sam",13,18,13,18],["Song",5,5,5,5],["Luke",11,7,11,7]]},{"text":"Admission to, gained by knocking at the door — Ac 12:13; Re 3:20.","refs":[["Acts",12,13,12,13],["Rev",3,20,3,20]]},{"text":"Walls of, plastered — Le 14:42,43.","refs":[["Lev",14,42,14,42],["Lev",14,43,14,43]]},{"text":"Serpents often lodged in walls of — Am 5:19.","refs":[["Amos",5,19,5,19]]},{"text":"Custom of fastening nails, & c, in walls of, alluded to — Ec 12:11; Isa 22:23.","refs":[["Eccl",12,11,12,11],["Isa",22,23,22,23]]},{"text":"Had often several stories — Eze 41:16; Ac 20:9.","refs":[["Ezek",41,16,41,16],["Acts",20,9,20,9]]},{"text":"Divided into apartments — Ge 43:30; Isa 26:20.","refs":[["Gen",43,30,43,30],["Isa",26,20,26,20]]},{"text":"Large and airy. — Jer 22:14.","refs":[["Jer",22,14,22,14]]},{"text":"Ceiled and painted. — Jer 22:14; Hag 1:4.","refs":[["Jer",22,14,22,14],["Hag",1,4,1,4]]},{"text":"Inlaid with ivory. — 1Ki 22:39; Am 3:15.","refs":[["1Kgs",22,39,22,39],["Amos",3,15,3,15]]},{"text":"Hung with rich tapestries. — Es 1:6.","refs":[["Esth",1,6,1,6]]},{"text":"Warmed with fires. — Jer 36:22; Joh 18:18.","refs":[["Jer",36,22,36,22],["John",18,18,18,18]]},{"text":"Upper apartments of, the best, and used for entertainments — Mr 14:15.","refs":[["Mark",14,15,14,15]]},{"text":"Had often detached apartments for secrecy and for strangers — Jdj 3:20-23; 2Ki 4:10,11; 9:2,3.","refs":[["Judg",3,20,3,23],["2Kgs",4,10,4,10],["2Kgs",4,11,4,11],["2Kgs",9,2,9,2],["2Kgs",9,3,9,3]]},{"text":"Lighted by windows — 1Ki 7:4.","refs":[["1Kgs",7,4,7,4]]},{"text":"Street windows of, high and dangerous — 2Ki 1:2; 9:30,33; Ac 20:9.","refs":[["2Kgs",1,2,1,2],["2Kgs",9,30,9,30],["2Kgs",9,33,9,33],["Acts",20,9,20,9]]},{"text":"Great. — Isa 5:9; Am 6:11; 2Ti 2:20.","refs":[["Isa",5,9,5,9],["Amos",6,11,6,11],["2Tim",2,20,2,20]]},{"text":"Goodly. — De 8:12.","refs":[["Deut",8,12,8,12]]},{"text":"Pleasant. — Eze 26:12; Mic 2:9.","refs":[["Ezek",26,12,26,12],["Mic",2,9,2,9]]},{"text":"Plastered. — Eze 13:10,11.","refs":[["Ezek",13,10,13,10],["Ezek",13,11,13,11]]},{"text":"Easily broken through. — Job 24:16; Eze 12:5.","refs":[["Job",24,16,24,16],["Ezek",12,5,12,5]]},{"text":"Often swept away by torrents. — Eze 13:13,14.","refs":[["Ezek",13,13,13,13],["Ezek",13,14,13,14]]},{"text":"When finished were usually dedicated — De 20:5; Ps 30:1.","refs":[["Deut",20,5,20,5],["Ps",30,1,30,1]]},{"text":"For summer residence — Am 3:15.","refs":[["Amos",3,15,3,15]]},{"text":"Liable to leprosy — Le 14:34-53.","refs":[["Lev",14,34,14,53]]},{"text":"Not to be coveted — Ex 20:17; Mic 2:2.","refs":[["Exod",20,17,20,17],["Mic",2,2,2,2]]},{"text":"Were hired — Ac 28:30.","refs":[["Acts",28,30,28,30]]},{"text":"Were mortgaged — Ne 5:3.","refs":[["Neh",5,3,5,3]]},{"text":"Were sold — Ac 4:34.","refs":[["Acts",4,34,4,34]]},{"text":"Law respecting the sale of — Le 25:29-33.","refs":[["Lev",25,29,25,33]]},{"text":"Of criminals, desolated — Da 2:5; 3:29.","refs":[["Dan",2,5,2,5],["Dan",3,29,3,29]]},{"text":"Desolation of, threatened as a punishment — Isa 5:9; 13:16,21,22; Eze 16:41; 26:12.","refs":[["Isa",5,9,5,9],["Isa",13,16,13,16],["Isa",13,21,13,21],["Isa",13,22,13,22],["Ezek",16,41,16,41],["Ezek",26,12,26,12]]},{"text":"Often broken down to repair city walls before sieges — Isa 22:10.","refs":[["Isa",22,10,22,10]]},{"text":"Of the body. — Job 4:19; 2Co 5:1.","refs":[["Job",4,19,4,19],["2Cor",5,1,5,1]]},{"text":"Of the grave. — Job 30:23.","refs":[["Job",30,23,30,23]]},{"text":"Of the church. — Heb 3:6; 1Pe 2:5.","refs":[["Heb",3,6,3,6],["1Pet",2,5,2,5]]},{"text":"Of saints’ inheritance. — Joh 14:2; 2Co 5:1.","refs":[["John",14,2,14,2],["2Cor",5,1,5,1]]},{"text":"(On sand,) of the delusive hope of hypocrites. — Mt 7:24,25.","refs":[["Matt",7,24,7,24],["Matt",7,25,7,25]]},{"text":"(On a rock,) of the hope of saints. — Mt 7:24,25.","refs":[["Matt",7,24,7,24],["Matt",7,25,7,25]]},{"text":"(Insecurity of,) of earthly trust. — Mt 6:19,20.","refs":[["Matt",6,19,6,19],["Matt",6,20,6,20]]},{"text":"(Building of,) of great prosperity. — Isa 65:21; Eze 28:26.","refs":[["Isa",65,21,65,21],["Ezek",28,26,28,26]]},{"text":"(Built and not inhabited,) of calamity. — De 28:30; Am 5:11; Zep 1:13.","refs":[["Deut",28,30,28,30],["Amos",5,11,5,11],["Zeph",1,13,1,13]]},{"text":"(To inhabit those, built by others,) of abundant feelings. — De 6:10,11.","refs":[["Deut",6,10,6,10],["Deut",6,11,6,11]]}],"refCount":128}
